    {
      "start": 150.18,
      "end": 151.4,
      "text": "Dɛn na wobɛka?"
    },
    {
      "start": 151.45,
      "end": 154.86,
      "text": "A: Mene Gouda gram 200."
    },
    {
      "start": 154.91,
      "end": 157.85,
      "text": "B: Aane, ɛbɛtumi ayɛ."
    },
    {
      "start": 157.9,
      "end": 162.12,
      "text": "C: Mepa wo kyɛw, mepɛ Gouda kyiisi gram 200."
    },
    {
      "start": 167.82,
      "end": 174.01,
      "text": "C! „Was darf's sein?“ kyerɛ kɛkɛ: Dɛn na wopɛ? Na „Ich hätte gern …“"
    },
    {
      "start": 174.06,
      "end": 179.31,
      "text": "(Mepɛ …) ma wobisa a obuo wɔ mu bere nyinaa – wɔ tɔnbea, paanoo tɔnfoɔ nkyɛn, kafe dan mu."
    },
    {
      "start": 179.56,
      "end": 180.96,
      "text": "Ka di m'akyi!"
    },
    {
      "start": 181.01,
      "end": 184.79,
      "text": "Mepa wo kyɛw, mepɛ Gouda kyiisi gram 200."
    },
    {
      "start": 190,
      "end": 195.81,
      "text": "Madam Haas twitwa kyiisi no. Nsenia no kyerɛ: gram 230."
    },
    {
      "start": 195.91,
      "end": 198.35,
      "text": "Ɛbɛyɛ sɛ ɛboro so kakra?"
    },
    {
      "start": 198.45,
      "end": 199.68,
      "text": "Dɛn na wobɛka?"
    },
    {
      "start": 199.72,
      "end": 202.74,
      "text": "A: Daabi, wɔmma me kwan."
    },
    {
      "start": 202.79,
      "end": 205.97,
      "text": "B: Aane, ɛyɛ."
    },
    {
      "start": 206.02,
      "end": 209.67,
      "text": "C: Aane, meboro so kakra."
    },
    {
      "start": 215.37,
      "end": 223.63,
      "text": "B! Wote saa kasamu yi wɔ tɔnbea biara wɔ Gyaaman. Ɛkyerɛ: ɛboro deɛ wobisaeɛ so kakra – ɛyɛ?"
    },
    {
      "start": 223.68,
      "end": 228.05,
      "text": "Sɛ ɛnyɛ a, ka kɛkɛ: „Nein, bitte genau 200 Gramm.“ (Daabi, mepa wo kyɛw, gram 200 pɛpɛɛpɛ.)"
    },
    {
      "start": 228.3,
      "end": 229.86,
      "text": "Biribi foforɔ bio?"
    },
    {
      "start": 229.96,
      "end": 232.56,
      "text": "Daabi, meda wo ase. Ɛno ara ne no."
    },
    {
      "start": 232.66,
      "end": 234.06,
      "text": "Ka di m'akyi!"
    },
    {
      "start": 234.11,
      "end": 236.77,
      "text": "Aane, ɛyɛ."
    },
    {
      "start": 240.18,
      "end": 243.43,
      "text": "Daabi, meda wo ase. Ɛno ara ne no."
    },
    {
      "start": 248.04,
      "end": 253.2,
      "text": "Wokɔ so. Mpofirim wote amanneɛbɔ bi. Tie yie!"
    },
    {
      "start": 253.3,
      "end": 260.34,
      "text": "Adetɔfoɔ adɔfoɔ! Ɛnnɛ deɛ ne bo so atew: kwadu, kilo baako cent 99 pɛ."
    },
    {
      "start": 260.44,
      "end": 263.12,
      "text": "Kwadu kilo baako yɛ sɛn?"
    },
    {
      "start": 263.22,
