      "text": "A: 9,90 €"
    },
    {
      "start": 266.03,
      "end": 269.05,
      "text": "B: 1,99 €"
    },
    {
      "start": 269.1,
      "end": 271.78,
      "text": "C: cent 99"
    },
    {
      "start": 277.48,
      "end": 283.92,
      "text": "C! Cent 99. „Im Angebot“ kyerɛ: ne bo so atew ɛnnɛ sen daa."
    },
    {
      "start": 284.17,
      "end": 285.57,
      "text": "Ka di m'akyi!"
    },
    {
      "start": 285.62,
      "end": 288.49,
      "text": "Kwadu no bo so atew."
    },
    {
      "start": 292.64,
      "end": 298.22,
      "text": "Wokura toa hunu nso – a saa nsɛnkyerɛnne yi wɔ so: Pfand (toa ho sika). Ɛhe na wode kɔ?"
    },
    {
      "start": 298.32,
      "end": 302.54,
      "text": "A: Toa san gye mfiri no nkyɛn. Wonya sika san."
    },
    {
      "start": 302.59,
